    "updated_at": "2025-12-02T21:47:27Z",
    "body": "> But the platform tries not to make it easy to build things that aren't good for users, to discourage it.\n\nIf there is a business goal, it will be achieved. The platform could implement this better (if there is no consensus on accessibility issues, then at least everyone will suffer from the increase in the size of the JS bundle).\n\nSome time ago, I had to abandon popovers due to this and other minor issues and, as a result, implement everything in JS.",
